config VIDEO_MEDIATEK_DPE7
	tristate "MediaTek MT8188 DPE stereo disparity (DVS) driver"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	depends on OF
	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	help
	  V4L2 memory-to-memory driver for the DVS engine of the MT8188
	  depth engine (DPE): it matches a rectified left/right image pair
	  and returns a disparity map in 1/8 pixel.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called mtk_dpe7.
